  (hi_heap HI LB cr M1 (m_vmmaps model) -> srealizes RSEGS SCFG (@PMSP.cfg RSEGS fx1 R1 pc1 M1 model) K) ->
  srealizes RSEGS SCFG (@PMSP.cfg RSEGS fx R pc M model) K.
